      "title": "USB: Don't memdup a composite TVB after finalizing",
      "message": "USB: Don't memdup a composite TVB after finalizing\n\nThe whole point of the composite TVB is that it memdups when\nnecessary (access across a boundary between components) to produce\nflat real data, but on demand. If that doesn't work, then it's a\nproblem in epan in tvbuff_composite.c\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n",
